Package: indi-stable-3rdparty-drivers-celestronaux
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, indi-stable-core-libs
Description: Celestron AUX-protocol mount INDI driver
 indi_celestron_aux, speaking Celestron's AUX protocol directly rather than
 the NexStar serial protocol the core INDI driver uses. The only driver
 here that needs libgsl as well as libnova.
 .
 This is an unofficial third-party build. It is not affiliated with or
 endorsed by the INDI project.

# The LGPL-2.0-only group: every source file grants the Library GPL "version
# 2" with no "or later" clause. See debian/copyright, which also records why
# these ship the exact LGPL-2.0 text.
Package: indi-stable-3rdparty-drivers-nexdome
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, indi-stable-core-libs
Description: NexDome observatory dome INDI driver (firmware v3+)
 indi_nexdome, for NexDome domes running firmware v3 or later. Upstream
 rewrote this driver completely for v3; firmware v1 is not supported.
 .
 This is an unofficial third-party build. It is not affiliated with or
 endorsed by the INDI project.

