Package: indi-stable-3rdparty-drivers-openogma
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, indi-stable-core-libs
Description: OpenOGMA camera INDI driver
 indi_openogma, for OpenOGMA cameras.
 .
 The only AGPL-licensed package in this project. Neither source file
 carries a licence header, so the bundled AGPL-3 LICENSE.txt governs. The
 Affero clause binds operators who offer modified versions over a network;
 it adds no condition on redistributing this package.
 .
 This is an unofficial third-party build. It is not affiliated with or
 endorsed by the INDI project.

