Package: indi-stable-3rdparty-drivers-beefocus
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, indi-stable-core-libs
Description: BeeFocus network focuser INDI driver
 indi_beefocus, for the BeeFocus WiFi focuser, which the driver reaches
 over a network socket rather than a serial port.
 .
 Two source trees under different licences are compiled into the single
 binary: driver/ is LGPL-2.0-only and firmware/ is LGPL-2.1-only. See
 debian/copyright.
 .
 This is an unofficial third-party build. It is not affiliated with or
 endorsed by the INDI project.

